project/kit-modal-aria: anentrypoint-design modal shell (files-modals.js Backdrop/Modal -> ConfirmDialog/PromptDialog/FileViewer) renders .ds-modal with role=dialog + aria-modal=true + aria-labelledby pointing at the head id (ds-modal-head-<n>, monotonic _modalSeq). Before v0.0.179 the .ds-modal was a plain div with no dialog semantics. Focus-trap + Escape-close already lived in Backdrop. Witness: import @0.0.179, render ConfirmDialog, assert .ds-modal getAttribute(role)===dialog.